%% Sequence Diagram 2 — Voice Mock Interview loop (with Panic Control)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Candidate
    participant FE as React Frontend<br/>(Interview page)
    participant IR as Interview Router<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant IS as Interview Service
    participant GQ as Groq<br/>Llama 3.3 70B
    participant WH as Groq Whisper<br/>(STT)
    participant TTS as TTS Engine<br/>(voice out)
    participant DB as Supabase

    U->>FE: Start interview (select job/role)
    FE->>DB: read skills + job context (shared memory)
    FE->>IR: POST /interview/question {role, history, skills}
    IR->>IS: next_question()
    IS->>GQ: contextual prompt
    GQ-->>IS: adaptive question
    IS-->>FE: question text
    FE->>TTS: speak question
    TTS-->>U: 🔊 spoken question

    U->>FE: 🎤 spoken answer (recorded)
    FE->>IR: POST /interview/transcribe (audio)
    IR->>WH: transcribe()
    WH-->>IR: transcript
    IR-->>FE: transcript text
    FE->>IR: POST /interview/coach {question, answer}
    IR-->>FE: per-answer feedback
    Note over FE: loop continues adaptively (< 2 s target latency)

    opt Panic Button pressed
        U->>FE: 🆘 Panic
        FE-->>U: pause + breathing exercise + confidence tips
    end

    U->>FE: End interview
    FE->>IR: POST /interview/feedback {history}
    IR->>IS: feedback()
    IS->>GQ: evaluate full session
    GQ-->>IS: report
    IR->>DB: save session + turns + anxiety pre/post
    IR-->>FE: final feedback report
